<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-10-14T00:30:27.221Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 00:30:27 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Philippine Coast Guard, Navy and Marine Corps have recently repelled five Vietnam-flagged fishing boats near Kota Island and confronted the Chinese research vessel Tan Suo Yi Hao when it entered the area, while also blocking Chinese Coast Guard water-cannon attacks on Philippine ships conducting medical evacuations at Ayungin Shoal and in the Luzon Strait. An upgraded PCG station was opened on Pag-asa Island, strengthening the Philippines' presence on the disputed atoll, and the Philippine Navy conducted passing exercises with Japanese vessels. 176 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scmp.com/news/asia/southeast-asia/article/3370708/philippines-drops-3-impeachment-charges-against-sara-duterte-despite-evidence?utm_source=rss_feed&quot;&gt;South China Morning Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Baird Maritime&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxPT1lFbWt3TENHNUtBYUtpcE16R2trdU40djk0M1hkNWJ2X0g4M3NQMDlVcXFwb0M2TldkU1pRZlctRGtRb1EzNnlGbi1uaEZhZFpkZEF6M05lTVFDQkpYTzZ4aHBES3A4Q1RrTmtqVF9DRnp6TUhBYWNPdW5wZDdwQ09fWEI5WXZRbHJQdVFYdlNsQnZicjZnUGRIZ3FTOWlmM04xeU5oRUdaVXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Maritime Executive&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Manila Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxPaUVsVjZpNHY4OGluVVc1XzI2T01nV3ZPcF9Za2lyMEhrVDZQYkdZVTFiRlNCSkNrZGpJRnY2X09pVkNRcU4tV01QSVotbC1raVhyVU02anN6c3I4VW1jVEtoT0dORzQtQ3BsSkZKTWxSaTVDR0NHb3N1YzhkdktSdEJkeHVqRS11aE95VHQtYVdjeE9lWVdMdWI5U3BYSTNOVHVrV1lXR3V2eDN3LUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Indo-Pacific Defense FORUM&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibkFVX3lxTE91ZUR3dVlsVnhaWXFTOE82VFBMazV6YmFNRkNTaXlfNW5MRE1EZEVRTF9hcndrdEZKbURTV1lqNzd3TDZ5UmRZR